    // mutation (e.g. player.decipher's `searchParams.set('n', nResult)` / `set('pot', …)`)
    // is reflected by `toString()`. The previous version stored `href = raw` at construction
    // and `toString()` returned that frozen string — every searchParams mutation was silently
    // dropped, so deciphered `n`/added `pot` never made it into the URL (→ SABR 403).
